{% comment %}
  The long-form description paragraphs, rendered inside the first "Description"
  accordion in the product info column. Moved back from under the gallery in
  October 2026, as the full copy took too much room on mobile.

  Keyed on product.handle, not on the title, because a title edited in admin used
  to drop the page silently to the generic fallback. Unknown products fall back to
  the Shopify description.
{% endcomment %}

  {%- case product.handle -%}
  {%- when 'brook-champagne-gold-wall-mirror' -%}
    <p>More than just a mirror, the Brook is an architectural focal point designed for lasting beauty and unparalleled clarity. Its dynamic, bold asymmetry makes a statement in any room, from the entryway to the living room.</p>
    <p>The robust brushed stainless steel frame in a refined Champagne Gold finish resists corrosion and moisture, so it is as at home in a bathroom as it is in a bedroom. Mountable vertically or horizontally for total flexibility.</p>
  {%- when 'brook-matte-black-wall-mirror' -%}
    <p>The Brook Mirror in Matte Black instantly elevates any space, marrying bold, modern elegance with professional-grade durability. Its dynamic asymmetrical silhouette commands attention, equally at home in a pared-back entryway as in a statement bathroom.</p>
    <p>The robust brushed stainless steel frame in a refined Matte Black finish resists corrosion and moisture, making it as functional as it is beautiful. Mountable vertically or horizontally for total flexibility.</p>
  {%- when 'solenne-champagne-gold-full-length-mirror' -%}
    <p>The Solenne is more than a mirror. It is a sculpture for your wall. Its oversized, organic silhouette with flowing asymmetrical edges creates gallery-worthy drama in any space, from a dressing room to a grand entrance hall.</p>
    <p>Made in small batches, each Solenne features a brushed Champagne Gold premium stainless steel frame and 5mm ecological glass. Install it leaning against the wall or wall-mount it with the included hardware. Both positions are equally striking.</p>
  {%- when 'the-rib-end-table' -%}
    <p>The Rib is a hand-carved fluted column in solid hardwood, crowned with a smooth, generous round top. The vertical grooves, carved by hand, extend the full height of the column, creating light-catching detail that changes throughout the day.</p>
    <p>Use it as a side table, nightstand, plant stand, or display pedestal. It pairs beautifully with the Volta End Table to create a layered, considered interior.</p>
  {%- when 'the-volta-end-table' -%}
    <p>The Volta combines two materials that age well and only look better over time. A dark-stained hardwood base with ribbed arch relief carved into each face, crowned by a hand-selected natural marble slab with unique veining. No two pieces are ever identical.</p>
    <p>Use it as a side table beside a sofa or bed, as an accent piece in an entrance hall, or alongside the Rib End Table for a fully considered interior.</p>
  {%- else -%}
    {% if product.description != blank %}
      {{ product.description }}
    {% endif %}
  {%- endcase -%}
